WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.724
Welcome to Orbit. What people said. Our focus is Reported speech.

2
00:00:06.724 --> 00:00:18.552
When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order.

3
00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:21.236
He asked where the meeting was.

4
00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:24.365
She said she had sent a written summary.

5
00:00:24.365 --> 00:00:27.419
She said the office would close early.

6
00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:36.817
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
